Looking at this problem, I need to find the maximum value of σ where ∠XAB - ∠YAC = ∠XBC - ∠YBA = ∠XCA - ∠YCB = σ, with X, Y interior points of the triangle with A=(0,0), B=(1,0), C=(0,1).

